stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: mount
  Loading --> Ready: validated response
  Ready --> Ready: Show more loaded reasons
  Ready --> Filtered: select source
  Filtered --> Filtered: query or category changes
  Filtered --> Ready: Clear resets all filters
  Filtered --> Filtered: append or refresh retains source
  Filtered --> Ready: successful refresh removes selected source
  Filtered --> Retained: malformed refresh
  Retained --> Filtered: retry succeeds with source
  Filtered --> Filtered: More reasons with zero matches
  Filtered --> Retired: session invalidated during read
  Retired --> Retired: late response or refresh ignored
  Retired --> Disposed: dispose
